    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970417.0393.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970417.0393\n\nBADEN-BADEN, Germany, April 17 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nRussia-NATO deal to be signed in Paris May 27: Yeltsin\n\n\n\n\nPresident Boris Yeltsin said Thursday that Russia and NATO will sign an agreement defining their future relations at a summit meeting in Paris on May 27.\n\nSpeaking at a joint news conference with Chancellor Helmut Kohl, with whom he had several hours' talks in this western German spa town, Yeltsin said: \"We will now have to hurry up.\"\n\nKohl for his part said that \"there still remains a lot to do, but I see a good chance of success.\"",
